This is a native package built from the upstream repository itself, intended
for self-built installs on Debian and Ubuntu - not an archive candidate.

The build runs Maven, which downloads the (few) compile and test dependencies
from Maven Central on the first build. There is no offline build path.

    sudo apt install debhelper maven default-jdk-headless
    dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc -b          # or: scripts/build-deb.sh

The unit tests (the MS-NKPU protocol harness) run during the build; skip them
with DEB_BUILD_OPTIONS=nocheck.
